<title>ESTONIA: Estonia Aug trade deficit falls to 954 mln kroons.</title>
<headline>Estonia Aug trade deficit falls to 954 mln kroons.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's trade deficit dropped to 954 million kroons in August, compared with 1.28 billion kroons the previous month, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p> ESTONIAN TRADE BALANCE    Aug '96    July '96    Aug '95</p>
<p> Imports			 3.1	  2.9	   1.9</p>
<p> Exports			 2.1	  1.7	   2.4</p>
<p> Trade balance		-954 mln   -1.28	 -450 mln</p>
<p>Note -- all figures are in billions of kroons unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>MAJOR TRADING PARTNERS IN AUGUST</p>
<p> Imports (pct share)   Finland 33.3, Russia 12.6, Germany 9.4</p>
<p> Exports (pct share)   Finland 20.1, Russia 14.9, Sweden 11.8</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
</text>
